  "description": "Professional HTTP-based SDK for TAF Metadata Service. v7.0.1: Internal refactoring - connection endpoints now use URL builder pattern for consistency. v7.0.0: BREAKING - Namespace changes (SDK.Contracts → Contracts, SDK.Contracts.Results → Domain.Results). All duplicate DTOs removed from SDK (now uses bundled Contracts/Domain DLLs). Added connection management endpoints (GetConnectionsByEnvironmentAsync, GetConnectionsByAppAsync). Migration: Update all using statements from TAF.MetaData.SDK.Contracts.* to TAF.MetaData.Contracts.*. Features Clean Architecture, SOLID principles, industry-standard naming (IMetadataClient), explicit Context parameter support for both HTTP and background thread scenarios, comprehensive error handling, screen management endpoint, batch relations support, and GetAppObjectById endpoint for efficient GUID-based lookups.",
